# Rebuildable data, deliberately not committed.
# thailand.pmtiles: 469 MB full-detail (z14) OpenStreetMap basemap extract. It
#   is only the local source for data/basemap.pmtiles — the trimmed z12 archive
#   that IS committed, because GitHub Pages has to serve it and GitHub caps
#   files at 100 MB. Rebuild both with the pmtiles commands at the top of app.js.
# _cache.json: raw store-API responses, only used to make fetch_stores.py resumable.
data/thailand.pmtiles
data/_cache.json
# Run log from fetch_stores.py.
data/_fetch.log
